description.p:
R1 represents optionally substimted -(CH2)a-phenyl, in which a is 0, 1, 2 or 3, or, preferably, optionally substimted, optionally unsamrated, linear, branched or cyclic, 

 alkyl (which latter group may also be interrupted by an oxygen atom); R2 represents H; R3 represents H; R4 represents H or C1-2 alkyl; R5a and R5b either both represent H or both represent methyl; 

R6 represents one or more substiments selected from C1-6 alkyl, cyano, nitro, amino, C(0)N(H)R19 and/or -N(H)S(0)2R21;
